    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFOR SALE BY PUBLIC ONLINE AUCTION\nOnline Only Via LSL Auctions\nDate: Wednesday 11th November 2026 @ 12noon\nSolicitor: Alan Mooney, Ensor O'Connor, Melrose House, Westgate, Wexford.\n\n0.23Acre Coastal Plot of Land\n\nPlease note that there is currently no planning permission associated with this site and is for sale as seen.\n\nSituated in one of Wexford's most sought-after coastal locations, this attractive .23acre plot enjoys an exceptional setting within walking distance of the renowned Curracloe Beach and adjacent to The Raven Nature Reserve.\n\nThe charming village of Curracloe is just a 5-minute drive away, offering a range of local amenities while preserving its peaceful coastal atmosphere. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a well-located coastal plot in a highly desirable area."
